                           <hi rend="bold">Editorial note:</hi>
                           <lb/>
                           <lb/>
                           <hi rend="bold">The original book from which this E-text is taken consisted of 4 lines of verse at the bottom of colored illustrations of the circus procession.  The leaves were mounted on boards and joined together in an accordion-fold format which, fully extended, was 372 cm (146 inches, roughly 12 feet) in length. Thus, this book is to be scrolled horizontally, so that it will be viewed as was the original.</hi>
                        </cell>
